    "raw_title": "Anders (singer)",
    "qid": "Q60735942",
    "bio": "Anders Ly, known mononymously as Anders, is a Canadian singer, rapper and songwriter. Anders is a two-time Juno Award–nominated artist. He is best known for his debut EP, 669 (2017), and second EP, Twos (2018), both featuring production from Canadian Grammy-nominated music producers FrancisGotHeat and Luca “905LUCA” Polizzi, as well as for his hit single collaboration with Canadian DJ duo Loud Luxury titled \"Love No More,\" which peaked at number 44 on the Billboard Canadian Hot 100 chart and spent 20 weeks there. Anders released his latest single collaboration with Toronto-based music producer Dimi, “Not Impressed,” on May 5, 2023.",
