    "bio": "Jenifer Rice-Genzuk Henry, born as Jenifer Sara Rice-Genzuk and previously known as Jeni G., is an American screenwriter and former singer. She worked as an Executive Producer and co-showrunner on the Freeform series Grown-ish. Before her time as a screenwriter, she was a member of the American girl group Before Dark. She also served as a staff writer on MTV's Death Valley, an executive producer on BET's The Game and as a co-executive producer on the ABC series Black-ish.",
