    "bio": "Lauren Anderson is an American singer-songwriter and guitarist from Chicago, Illinois. While often cited as a blues artist, Anderson's work draws from multiple genres, including soul, rock, country, and Americana. Her albums have charted on the Billboard Blues Albums chart, and she has received multiple Josie Music Awards, including Best Jazz/Blues Vocalist of the Year in 2025. In 2025, she competed on Season 28 of NBC's The Voice as a member of Snoop Dogg's team.",
